@startuml
title Product Service - Search And Product View
actor User
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "ProductViewSet" as ProductAPI
database "Product DB" as ProductDB
participant "Interaction Service" as Interaction

== Search products ==
User -> Gateway: GET /api/products?search=keyword
Gateway -> ProductAPI: list/filter query
ProductAPI -> ProductDB: Query active products by text/category/brand
ProductDB --> ProductAPI: product list
ProductAPI -> Interaction: POST search_performed
Interaction --> ProductAPI: 201 event recorded
ProductAPI --> Gateway: products
Gateway --> User: products

== View product detail ==
User -> Gateway: GET /api/products/{id}
Gateway -> ProductAPI: retrieve(id)
ProductAPI -> ProductDB: Load product + variants/category/brand
ProductDB --> ProductAPI: product detail
ProductAPI -> Interaction: POST product_viewed
Interaction --> ProductAPI: 201 event recorded
ProductAPI --> Gateway: product detail
Gateway --> User: product detail
@enduml

